  "headline": "Prabowo To Convene Coalition Leaders Regarding Vice President Picks",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo To Convene Coalition Leaders Regarding Vice…",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo is set to gather coalition party leaders to discuss two proposed names for the vice president vacancy before presenting them to the MPR.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo is scheduled to meet with coalition party leaders to discuss the selection of two vice presidential candidates.",
    "Leadership from political parties, including PKS, Golkar, and the Democratic Party, have confirmed being asked to remain on standby for the meeting.",
    "The proposed names for the vice president role are expected to be submitted to the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) following this consultation."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The political landscape in Indonesia remains focused on the vacancy in the vice president's office following the departure of Gibran Rakabuming Raka. President Prabowo Subianto has been engaging with the leadership of his coalition parties to determine a path forward for this succession. While earlier discussions in mid-November focused on managing food inflation and initial strategy, recent reports confirm that party chairmen have been placed on standby for a new meeting with the President. Representatives from major political factions, including the Prosperous Justice Party (PKS), Golkar, and the Democratic Party, have indicated that the agenda for this upcoming assembly is to finalize two candidate names for the vice presidency. Once consensus is reached among the coalition, these nominations are slated to be officially presented to the People's Consultative Assembly for the final legislative process.",
